WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:09.108
&gt;&gt; IT LOOKS CLEAR RIGHT NOW THE

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:09.868
&gt;&gt; IT LOOKS CLEAR RIGHT NOW THE

00:00:09.902 --> 00:00:11.718
FIRST OR SECOND WEEK IN JUNE TO

00:00:11.752 --> 00:00:13.962
GO INTO PHASE ONE.

00:00:13.963 --> 00:00:14.830
MANUFACTURING, CONSTRUCTION,

00:00:14.831 --> 00:00:16.124
WHOLESALE, AND RETAIL ONLY FOR

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:17.268
CURBSIDE PICKUP.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.326
THOSE ARE THE BIG STANDARDS, AND

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.202
THEN WE WILL FILL IN A LOT OF

00:00:21.236 --> 00:00:22.385
BLANKS BETWEEN NOW AND THEN

00:00:22.386 --> 00:00:24.838
ABOUT HOW TO DO THOSE THINGS AND

00:00:24.872 --> 00:00:26.066
HOW TO APPROACH THEM SAFELY.

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:28.654
BUT I THINK IT’S GOING TO BE

00:00:28.688 --> 00:00:31.024
FIRST OR SECOND WEEK IN JUNE,

00:00:31.026 --> 00:00:32.686
UNLESS -- UNLESS PEOPLE GET

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:33.821
UNDISCIPLINED AND START TO LOSE

00:00:33.855 --> 00:00:36.642
TRACK OF THE STANDARDS, AND WE

00:00:36.643 --> 00:00:37.806
START TO SEE A RESURGENCE.

00:00:37.808 --> 00:00:41.353
&gt;&gt; Neil: YOU COULD ALMOST HEAR

00:00:41.387 --> 00:00:43.636
ALL OF NEW YORK CITY’S BUSINESS

00:00:43.671 --> 00:00:45.983
AS SAY ARE YOU KIDDING ME?

00:00:45.984 --> 00:00:47.760
THE NEW YORK CITY MAYOR,

00:00:47.761 --> 00:00:51.336
BILL de BLASIO, DRAGGING THE

00:00:51.338 --> 00:00:52.322
SHUTDOWN OUT.

00:00:52.323 --> 00:00:54.193
PARTICULARLY TO YOU WHEN HE

00:00:54.228 --> 00:00:55.114
WANTS TO DO THIS.

00:00:55.148 --> 00:00:58.130
THE FIRST, SECOND, MAYBE THIRD

00:00:58.132 --> 00:00:59.332
WEEK OF JUNE.

00:00:59.366 --> 00:01:00.774
THEY COULD BE DONE ENTIRELY.

00:01:00.808 --> 00:01:02.509
CONGRESSMAN, WHAT DO YOU THINK

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:04.413
OF WHAT THE MAYOR IS SAYING?

00:01:04.414 --> 00:01:06.532
THIS IS STILL SOME WEEKS OFF.

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:08.324
&gt;&gt; YET, MY FRIEND, THANK YOU SO

00:01:08.325 --> 00:01:09.255
MUCH FOR HAVING ME.

00:01:09.256 --> 00:01:11.482
LET’S THINK ABOUT THE SMALL

00:01:11.483 --> 00:01:12.633
BUSINESS OWNER RIGHT NOW.

00:01:12.634 --> 00:01:15.091
THE GUY WHO OWNS A SHOE STORE,

00:01:15.092 --> 00:01:15.745
FOR INSTANCE.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:19.663
FOUR MONTHS HAS SEEN THE LIQUOR

00:01:19.698 --> 00:01:23.539
STORE OPEN, OKAY -- AS IF THE

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:25.243
LIQUOR STORE HAS SOME ABILITY TO

00:01:25.244 --> 00:01:27.132
HYPNOTIZE COVID BEFORE IT COMES

00:01:27.134 --> 00:01:30.289
INTO THE STORE TO STOP IT, BUT

00:01:30.291 --> 00:01:31.503
THE SHOE STORE DOESN’T.

00:01:31.505 --> 00:01:32.480
LET’S BE SENSIBLE.

00:01:32.481 --> 00:01:34.352
THE MAYOR’S COMMENTS ARE COMING

00:01:34.353 --> 00:01:36.503
OFF AS IF HE IS AN ELITIST

00:01:36.504 --> 00:01:37.155
DILETTANTE THAT DOESN’T

00:01:37.156 --> 00:01:39.036
UNDERSTAND THE STRUGGLES OF OUR

00:01:39.037 --> 00:01:40.853
SMALL BUSINESS OWNERS.

00:01:40.854 --> 00:01:44.021
YOU KNOW, WE CAN DO THIS

00:01:44.023 --> 00:01:45.635
RESPONSIBLY, BUT WE HAVE TO HAVE

00:01:45.636 --> 00:01:47.091
THAT SENSE OF URGENCY.

00:01:47.126 --> 00:01:48.869
AROUND THE MOMS AND POPS THAT

00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:49.904
HAVE DEDICATED THEIR LIVES TO

00:01:49.905 --> 00:01:50.907
THESE BUSINESSES.

00:01:50.908 --> 00:01:54.354
I COME FROM A LONG LINE OF SMALL

00:01:54.355 --> 00:01:55.315
BUSINESS OWNERS, AND I

00:01:55.317 --> 00:01:57.534
UNDERSTAND, JUST AS SO MANY

00:01:57.568 --> 00:01:59.265
NEW YORKERS DO, THAT IS NOT A

00:01:59.266 --> 00:02:00.001
95.

00:02:00.035 --> 00:02:02.372
THAT IS YOUR ENTIRE LIFE.

00:02:02.406 --> 00:02:04.730
THEY ARE WATCHING THEIR SMALL

00:02:04.732 --> 00:02:08.669
BUSINESSES WHETHER ON THE VINE.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:11.033
WE HAVE GOT TO DO SOMETHING.

00:02:11.068 --> 00:02:13.053
ISSUE STANDARDS, DISTRIBUTE PPE

00:02:13.088 --> 00:02:16.099
AND A MASSIVE WAY, AND LET’S

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:17.869
START TO GET THIS THING OPEN.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:20.012
MOST SMALL BUSINESS OWNERS ARE

00:02:20.013 --> 00:02:20.692
INCREDIBLY SMART.

00:02:20.693 --> 00:02:23.149
ESPECIALLY IN NEW YORK CITY.

00:02:23.183 --> 00:02:25.097
THEY UNDERSTAND THAT 25%

00:02:25.131 --> 00:02:26.661
OCCUPANCY RATE, THAT’S JUST THE

00:02:26.662 --> 00:02:26.958
BEGINNING.

00:02:26.992 --> 00:02:29.118
TIMES ARE STILL GOING TO BE

00:02:29.152 --> 00:02:30.568
REALLY DIFFICULT, BUT AT LEAST

00:02:30.569 --> 00:02:34.059
IT’S A START, AND THEY ARE

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:35.206
DESERVING, IF NOTHING LESS.

00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:37.377
&gt;&gt; Neil: YOU ARE A

00:02:37.412 --> 00:02:38.560
UNITED STATES CONGRESSMAN, SOUTH

00:02:38.594 --> 00:02:40.772
YOU CAN WEIGH IN AND MAYBE TRY

00:02:40.807 --> 00:02:42.886
TO INFLUENCE THE MAYOR, BECAUSE

00:02:42.887 --> 00:02:44.886
IT DOES SEEM TO BE CIRCULAR TO

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.516
THE GUIDELINES WE ARE HEARING

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:47.918
FROM NEAR GOVERNOR CUOMO.

00:02:47.919 --> 00:02:50.415
WHAT IS HE LOOKING AT THAT

00:02:50.449 --> 00:02:51.726
OTHERS ARE NOT?

00:02:51.728 --> 00:02:52.042
INCIDENTS?

00:02:52.043 --> 00:02:53.909
HOSPITAL RISK, ALL DRAMATICALLY

00:02:53.911 --> 00:02:56.024
DOWN IN THE CITY AND ALL THE

00:02:56.058 --> 00:02:56.570
BOROUGHS.

00:02:56.571 --> 00:02:58.472
SO WHAT IS HE BASING THIS ON?

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.235
DO YOU KNOW?

00:03:00.269 --> 00:03:01.203
&gt;&gt; WELL, LOOK.

00:03:01.204 --> 00:03:04.314
I AM NOT GOING TO SAY THAT WE

00:03:04.315 --> 00:03:06.342
SHOULDN’T BE LOOKING UP SCIENCE

00:03:06.343 --> 00:03:08.229
AND WE SHOULDN’T BE CONSULTING

00:03:08.264 --> 00:03:10.404
METRICS AND TRUSTED EXPERTS IN

00:03:10.439 --> 00:03:12.920
THIS REGARD, BUT WHAT I THINK HE

00:03:12.922 --> 00:03:15.274
IS NOW LOOKING AT, WHICH IS THE

00:03:15.309 --> 00:03:16.567
CRITICAL THING -- WE KNOW HE’S

00:03:16.569 --> 00:03:17.882
LOOKING AT HOSPITALIZATION AND

00:03:17.917 --> 00:03:20.347
THIS AND THAT, BUT WHAT HE IS

00:03:20.381 --> 00:03:23.212
NOT LOOKING AT IS THE POTENTIAL

00:03:23.213 --> 00:03:25.209
FOR A CONTINUED ECONOMIC NUCLEAR

00:03:25.211 --> 00:03:27.239
BOMB TO GO OFF EACH AND EVERY

00:03:27.241 --> 00:03:30.021
WEEKEND NEW YORK CITY AS OUR

00:03:30.055 --> 00:03:31.492
SMALL BUSINESSES, OUR MOM AND

00:03:31.493 --> 00:03:32.261
POPS DIET.

00:03:32.262 --> 00:03:33.569
AT THEIR CUSTOMERS RIGHT NOW GET

00:03:33.603 --> 00:03:35.139
TO GO TO TARGET.

00:03:35.141 --> 00:03:36.521
THEIR CUSTOMERS GET TO GO TO

00:03:36.556 --> 00:03:38.255
HOME DEPOT.

00:03:38.289 --> 00:03:40.322
TWO LARGE SUPERMARKETS, AND THEY

00:03:40.357 --> 00:03:41.659
CANNOT GO TO THE SMALL

00:03:41.661 --> 00:03:42.493
BUSINESSES.

00:03:42.527 --> 00:03:44.058
IT DOESN’T MAKE SENSE.

00:03:44.059 --> 00:03:47.679
AND ALL WE ARE ASKING FOR, ALL

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.181
THEY ARE ASKING FOR IS SOME

00:03:50.183 --> 00:03:53.514
SENSE OF GUIDANCE AND SOME SENSE

00:03:53.549 --> 00:03:55.038
OF URGENCY THAT GIVES THEM

00:03:55.040 --> 00:03:55.545
RESOURCES --

00:03:55.546 --> 00:03:58.130
&gt;&gt; Neil: THEY ARE NOT GETTING

00:03:58.131 --> 00:03:59.235
IT FROM THE MAYOR, CONGRESSMAN.

00:03:59.236 --> 00:04:01.776
&gt;&gt; NOW, THEY ARE NOT, AND THAT’S

00:04:01.811 --> 00:04:02.470
A PROBLEM.

00:04:02.505 --> 00:04:04.652
&gt;&gt; Neil: SOME OF THEM ARE

00:04:04.653 --> 00:04:06.111
ALREADY OPENING UP, SO I’M

00:04:06.112 --> 00:04:07.364
WONDERING, TECHNICALLY, THEY

00:04:07.365 --> 00:04:09.817
WOULD BE IN VIOLATION OF THE

00:04:09.851 --> 00:04:12.256
MAYOR’S ORDERS AND BY EXTENSION,

00:04:12.291 --> 00:04:13.406
THE GOVERNOR’S ORDERS.

00:04:13.441 --> 00:04:16.242
FOR THOSE WHO MAY FEEL TEMPTED,

00:04:16.243 --> 00:04:17.855
I’M GOING TO OPEN UP, ALLOW

00:04:17.889 --> 00:04:20.084
SIDEWALK SERVICE, SHOULD THEY BE

00:04:20.085 --> 00:04:21.482
PENALIZED FOR DOING THAT?

00:04:21.484 --> 00:04:23.725
&gt;&gt; LOOK, MY FRIEND, I’M NOT

00:04:23.727 --> 00:04:25.365
GOING TO COME ON YOUR SHOW AND

00:04:25.366 --> 00:04:27.224
ADVOCATE FOR ANYONE TO BREAK THE

00:04:27.258 --> 00:04:28.655
LAW OR GO AGAINST THE MAYOR’S

00:04:28.657 --> 00:04:30.772
GUIDANCE, BUT WHAT I AM COMING

00:04:30.807 --> 00:04:33.790
ON HERE TO SAY IS THAT THIS

00:04:33.792 --> 00:04:37.214
MAYOR’S LEADERSHIP AT THIS

00:04:37.215 --> 00:04:39.660
POINT -- MESSAGE IS PITIFUL, AND

00:04:39.661 --> 00:04:42.519
THIS CITY WILL BE BETTER OFF

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:44.198
WHEN HE IS NO LONGER THE MAYOR.

00:04:44.232 --> 00:04:45.597
THIS IS AN ENORMOUS

00:04:45.631 --> 00:04:46.735
DISAPPOINTMENT, AND OUR

00:04:46.737 --> 00:04:48.884
BUSINESSES ARE GOING TO SUFFER.

00:04:48.885 --> 00:04:50.238
NOW, THERE ARE CERTAIN THINGS,

00:04:50.273 --> 00:04:50.974
THOUGH, THAT THE FEDERAL

00:04:51.009 --> 00:04:54.335
GOVERNMENT CAN BE DOING AS WELL.

00:04:54.336 --> 00:04:56.630
I CAME OUT SAYING THAT THAT

00:04:56.664 --> 00:04:57.743
PRESIDENT SHOULD BE PUSHING PPE

00:04:57.745 --> 00:05:00.348
DOWN TO OUR SMALL BUSINESSES.

00:05:00.382 --> 00:05:02.288
WE HAVE TO EXTEND THAT PROGRAM I

00:05:02.289 --> 00:05:04.078
ASKED OF THE EIGHT WEEK DEADLINE

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.221
TO 24 WEEKS, AND WE CERTAINLY

00:05:06.256 --> 00:05:09.388
HAVE TO GET RID OF THIS

00:05:09.422 --> 00:05:10.711
RIDICULOUS 75/25 RATIO.

00:05:10.745 --> 00:05:12.025
IF YOU’RE A SMALL BUSINESS

00:05:12.059 --> 00:05:14.315
OWNER, YOUR RENT IS SOMETIMES

00:05:14.316 --> 00:05:15.150
50% OF YOUR COST.

00:05:15.151 --> 00:05:18.321
WE HAVE TO FIX THAT SO THAT THEY

00:05:18.355 --> 00:05:19.260
CAN STAY OPEN.

00:05:19.294 --> 00:05:22.186
&gt;&gt; Neil: LET ME ASK YOU THIS.

00:05:22.187 --> 00:05:24.309
THE PRESIDENT AND HE WAS PUSHING

00:05:24.311 --> 00:05:25.246
THAT HOUSES OF WORSHIP OPEN.

00:05:25.247 --> 00:05:28.630
I TALKED TO A RABBI AND A PRIEST

00:05:28.631 --> 00:05:30.132
ON THIS ISSUE, SAYING THAT THEY

00:05:30.133 --> 00:05:32.991
WILL OBVIOUSLY HONOR REASONABLE

00:05:33.025 --> 00:05:34.580
CAPACITY REQUIREMENTS, BUT THEN

00:05:34.614 --> 00:05:36.820
THEY COME OUT WITH A STATEMENT

00:05:36.855 --> 00:05:38.294
SAYING WE WILL CONTINUE TO WORK

00:05:38.328 --> 00:05:41.005
CLOSELY WITH PHASE LEADERS TO

00:05:41.007 --> 00:05:42.951
ENSURE THAT PEOPLE CAN SAFELY

00:05:42.952 --> 00:05:43.187
WORSHIP.

00:05:43.188 --> 00:05:46.262
BUT WE WILL NOT TAKE STEPS THAT

00:05:46.296 --> 00:05:47.348
WILL JEOPARDIZE NEW YORKERS

00:05:47.382 --> 00:05:47.549
HEALTH.

00:05:47.583 --> 00:05:49.910
THE FACT OF THE MATTER IS THEY

00:05:49.911 --> 00:05:51.483
HAVE NOT BEEN SUPPORTING LARGE

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:52.102
GATHERINGS IN CHURCHES.

00:05:52.137 --> 00:05:54.284
THEY HAVE NEVER BEEN DOING THAT,

00:05:54.285 --> 00:05:55.578
SO OBVIOUSLY, THEY ARE GOING TO

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.411
CONTINUE TO HONOR WHAT THEY HAVE

00:05:57.412 --> 00:05:58.496
ALWAYS BEEN DOING, WHICH IS NOT

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.523
WHAT THE PRESIDENT SO THEY

00:06:00.557 --> 00:06:01.394
SHOULD BE DOING.

00:06:01.428 --> 00:06:03.752
SHOULD YOU AND DO YOU HAVE

00:06:03.786 --> 00:06:04.885
PROBLEMS WITH ANY PEOPLE OF

00:06:04.886 --> 00:06:07.276
FAITH, ANY HOUSE OF WORSHIP,

00:06:07.277 --> 00:06:09.997
ONCE AGAIN, RETURNING TO THOSE

00:06:10.031 --> 00:06:11.457
PLACES OF FAITH, EVEN HONORING

00:06:11.492 --> 00:06:12.263
SOCIAL DISTANCING AND OTHER

00:06:12.264 --> 00:06:13.813
GUIDELINES THAT WE HAVE SEEN IN

00:06:13.848 --> 00:06:15.880
OTHER STATES?

00:06:15.914 --> 00:06:17.060
&gt;&gt; ABSOLUTELY.

00:06:17.061 --> 00:06:17.662
LOOK.

00:06:17.696 --> 00:06:20.036
YOU LOOK BACK THREE MONTHS OR SO

00:06:20.037 --> 00:06:22.515
SO, THE PRESIDENT’S I ACTUALLY

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:26.165
CORRECTLY NOTED THAT OPENING AND

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.375
CLOSING SHOULD BE DECISIONS MADE

00:06:28.409 --> 00:06:29.698
ACCORDING TO DECISIONS BY

00:06:29.699 --> 00:06:29.922
GOVERNORS.

00:06:29.923 --> 00:06:31.990
THIS IS A DECISION THAT CANNOT

00:06:31.991 --> 00:06:33.441
BE MADE ON A NATIONAL BASIS AND

00:06:33.443 --> 00:06:35.652
HAS TO BE MADE IN PARTNERSHIP

00:06:35.686 --> 00:06:38.019
WITH OUR FAITH-BASED LEADERS.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.629
LOOKING AT THESE ORGANIZATIONS

00:06:39.663 --> 00:06:41.232
IN NEW YORK CITY, I THINK THERE

00:06:41.266 --> 00:06:43.061
IS AN OVERARCHING CONSENSUS THAT

00:06:43.095 --> 00:06:44.615
WE ARE NOT YET AT THE POINT

00:06:44.616 --> 00:06:47.268
WHERE WE CAN BEGIN TO OPEN, BUT

00:06:47.303 --> 00:06:50.568
WHAT WE SHOULD START TO DO IS

00:06:50.602 --> 00:06:52.097
TELL PEOPLE WHEN IT WILL HAPPEN.

00:06:52.131 --> 00:06:54.866
I REMEMBER BACK TO WHEN I WAS AN

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.493
ARMY RANGER SCHOOL.

00:06:55.495 --> 00:06:57.612
THE WORST THING THEY CAN EVER DO

00:06:57.613 --> 00:07:00.342
TO YOU WAS NOT TELL YOU WHEN IT

00:07:00.343 --> 00:07:01.435
WAS GOING TO END.

00:07:01.436 --> 00:07:04.492
THAT WAS WHAT I FEARED MORE THAN

00:07:04.493 --> 00:07:05.051
ANYTHING ELSE.

00:07:05.052 --> 00:07:07.114
AND THAT IS THE PLACE THAT MOST

00:07:07.115 --> 00:07:08.468
NEW YORKERS ARE IN RIGHT NOW.

00:07:08.469 --> 00:07:09.254
THEY’VE BEEN DOING THE RIGHT

00:07:09.255 --> 00:07:09.981
THING.

00:07:09.982 --> 00:07:12.198
THEY HAVE SAVED LIVES.

00:07:12.199 --> 00:07:15.723
NOW THEY HAVE TO BE TOLD WHEN

00:07:15.758 --> 00:07:16.945
TIMES CAN GET BACK.

00:07:16.979 --> 00:07:18.709
&gt;&gt; Neil: CONGRESSMAN, BE SAFE,

